<title>USA: Bristol-Myers sets $350 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Bristol-Myers sets $350 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Bristol-Myers Squibb Co was priced via Goldman Sachs &amp; Co on Tuesday according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER BRISTOL-MYERS SQUIBB CO</p>
<p>AMT $350 MLN	 COUPON 6.80 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 98.866  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AAA   YIELD 6.89 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 SPREAD 34 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING 6.75 PERCENT ISSUE DUE AUGUST 2026</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
